{"id":"vod_sn_38950","vodId":"38950","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"蔷薇少女","name_cn":"蔷薇少女","date":"2004-01-01","year":"2004","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/a81211f7318d369ca089acfef652417c.jpg"},"summary":"某一日，对生活毫无干劲，只知道在网上购物的颓废男樱田纯（真田麻美 配音）收到了一封写着“上发条”和“不上发条”的信，好奇的他选择了前者，没想到，就因为这无意中的选择，一个充满神奇和争斗的残酷世界向他打开了大门。　　名叫真红（泽城美雪 配音）的人偶出现在了纯的面前。原来，在百年之前，人偶制造的技术由于“蔷薇圣母”的发现而突飞猛进，于是，7个有自己的意识和思维的人偶诞生了。可是，制造者并不满足于此，他希望能够制作出最完美的人偶——爱丽丝，而怀着对制造者的爱，一场激烈的，夺取蔷薇圣母成为完美爱丽丝的战争在7个人偶之间展开。此时，新一轮的争夺即将开始，作为真红的新主人，纯会开始怎样惊险的冒险呢？","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 16:06:04","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/dXk5YyQtrt1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Nr2L8M4PFt1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/GUTKwQYcL01/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/aCgmGT6bsP1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/dvmCiG9MuZ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/W9Bg2JUQZ91/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Y7tPThbPvf1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/LZRDm38pyF1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Bq44BK5eUA1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/VFYxckUAwG1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/XfK9zcfRkA1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/9sGyVcHHCy1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:44:52.325Z"}